{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The benchmark suite measures the same workloads at several committed FirebladeECS revisions, such as a release tag against "},{"code":"main","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The workloads cover entity creation, destruction and lookup, adding and removing components, iterating families, system updates and component events. Revisions with value-type components run each workload on both the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"archetype"},{"type":"text","text":" and the "},{"code":"sparseSet","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" storage (see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"), so a report also shows what the storage choice costs."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"How-results-are-made-trustworthy","text":"How results are made trustworthy","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each revision is built once and measured in ","type":"text"},{"code":"k","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" independent process replicates, interleaved in a seeded random order. The replicate is the unit of analysis: the centre value is the median of the replicate medians, with a distribution-free order-statistic 95% confidence interval. A speed-up against the baseline is the Hodges–Lehmann estimate with its exact confidence interval, tested with an exact Mann–Whitney test and adjusted across all comparisons of a report with Benjamini–Hochberg. A change counts as ","type":"text"},{"code":"faster","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"slower","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" only when it is significant and clears the ±5% equivalence zone; an interval inside that zone is reported as "},{"code":"equivalent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", anything else as ","type":"text"},{"code":"inconclusive","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"text":"Read and reproduce","anchor":"Read-and-reproduce","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The latest published report: "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/fireblade-engine.github.io\/ecs\/benchmarks\/","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". Reports are published for dedicated benchmark releases only, the first one with 2.0.0; the page shows the newest.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The statistical design and workload parity notes: ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/fireblade-engine\/ecs\/blob\/main\/Documentation\/Benchmarks\/Methodology.md"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To measure revisions locally, pass comma-separated tags, branches or commit IDs. Results are saved under "},{"code":"Benchmarks\/Results\/<UTC timestamp>\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"code":["make benchmark-compare REFS=1.4.3,main:2.0.0 REPLICATES=10 BENCHMARK_FILTER='.*'","make benchmark-report RESULTS=\"Benchmarks\/Results\/<run>\/*.json\" REPORT_BASELINE=1.4.3"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"sh"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Without "},{"code":"BENCHMARK_FILTER","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" only 16 entities of every workload plus "},{"code":"entity.create.no-entities","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (which only has 0 entities) run. "},{"code":"make benchmark-report","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" renders the single file "},{"code":"BenchmarkReport.html","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" from saved results and never runs benchmarks. See "},{"code":"Benchmarks\/README.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for all options."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"See how FirebladeECS revisions compare on a shared workload suite, and run the comparison yourself.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"role":"article","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}],"title":"Benchmarks","roleHeading":"Article"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/benchmarks"]}],"kind":"article","sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Benchmarks"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/GettingStartedWithFirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReadingAndWritingComponents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentMacro","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReactingToNexusEvents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SavingAndLoadingScenes","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEvent","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventDelegate","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus\/StorageKind"],"title":"Essentials","generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials"}],"references":{"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/Nexus":{"title":"Nexus","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/nexus","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Nexus","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Nexus","k